<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi's Ahsa Development Co Q1 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Saudi's Ahsa Development Co Q1 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			  (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		3.54   vs     3.61</p>
<p> Income		    3.98   vs     4.16</p>
<p> Expenses		  0.45   vs     0.54</p>
<p> Assets		  353.46   vs   341.30</p>
<p>Full Name: Al-Ahsa Development Company.</p>
<p>Note - Saudi's industrial giant Saudi Basic Industries Corp holds a 10 percent stake in the company and the rest is owned by Saudi and other Gulf Arab investors.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom - 973-524424.</p>
</text>
